  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>For runners who are all about maximum cushioning, the Nike Vomero Plus ESS sets the tone from the very first stride. Featuring a fully stacked, ultra-responsive ZoomX foam midsole, these shoes deliver exceptional energy return and unbridled cushioning to create a remarkable road running experience. The engineered mesh upper, crafted from soft, breathable yarn, ensures lightweight comfort and ventilation mile after mile, while the webbed lace loops keep your foot steady throughout. Whether you’re hitting the pavement or chasing big mileage goals, the Nike Vomero Plus ESS is as serious about running as you are.</p> <p><strong>Nike Vomero Plus ESS features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Mesh upper offers soft breathability.</li> <li>Reflective details enable low-light visibility.</li> <li>Ultra-responsive ZoomX foam midsole delivers Nike’s highest energy return.</li> <li>High-abrasion rubber outsole offers durable traction.</li> <li>Weight: 8.5 oz</li> <li>Heel-to-toe drop: 10 mm.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Long runs, recovery miles, and busy days on your feet all feel smoother in the Nike Vomero Plus ESS. Built for runners who want a plush ride without giving up energy return, this road-ready silhouette pairs a breathable engineered mesh upper with a fully stacked ZoomX foam midsole for soft landings and a bouncy, protected feel from the first mile to the last.</p><ul><li>Engineered mesh upper delivers lightweight breathability.</li><li>Webbed lace loops help create a secure, steady fit.</li><li>Reflective details add low-light visibility.</li><li>Full ZoomX foam midsole provides Nike's highest level of energy return.</li><li>High-abrasion rubber outsole adds durable traction.</li><li>Weight: 8.5 oz.</li><li>Heel-to-toe drop: 10 mm.</li></ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>For the best fit, we recommend going true to size if you like a secure, performance feel. If you prefer a little more room through the forefoot or usually size up in cushioned running shoes, many runners found a half-size up worked well.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for daily road miles, long runs, recovery runs, walking, and anyone who wants premium cushioning for extended time on their feet.</p> <p><strong>Cushioning & Road Feel</strong></p><p>Reviewers consistently call out the soft, cloud-like cushioning and springy ride, with many saying it helps reduce fatigue over long distances and full workdays. The feel underfoot leans plush and protective, making it especially well suited to easy miles, endurance training, and all-day comfort.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p><p>Most runners found the Vomero Plus ESS comfortable right out of the box, while some noted it settles in even more after a few runs. Repeat buyers also highlight dependable performance across heavy weekly mileage, making it a strong option for steady training rotation use.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero Plus ESS - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Summit White/Chalk/Pure Platinum</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;fon